{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02561","headline":"奉和圣制登三台言志应制 · 许敬宗","name":"奉和圣制登三台言志应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"中天表云榭，载极耸崑楼。\n圣作规玄造，轩阿复聿修。\n高门符令节，形胜总神州。\n企翼抟禽萃，飞甍燕雀游。\n缀星罗百拱，缘汉转三休。\n旦云生玉舃，初月上银钩。\n妙管含秦凤，仙姿丽斗牛。\n形言防处逸，粹藻发嘉猷。\n荷生无以谢，尽瘁竟何酬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许敬宗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02561.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02561","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}